the overall picture. Anyone who wants to says one sentence about their weather.\nTip: Lots of clouds or storms? Plan breaks or ask what would help.\n\n🛠️ Your role as facilitator\nHost: Lead by example and place your dot first.\nSafe space: Nobody has to explain their weather.","textFontFamily":"Inter","textSize":28,"textAlignment":"left","textColor":"#000000","attachedFrame":"mk-hwTMm-giJlbiXj39V0"}]}]}}